        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/5daacb/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2024-03-20T16:20:15.939Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I’m an avid Spirit Island player who has logged more than 100 plays since I bought the game last year! As such, my island boards are starting to show A LOT of wear, especially around the edges and the pointy part of the board. Are there any plans to release a “deluxe” island board of any kind? Something that’s made out of wood maybe? I know my friends and I would pay a premium price for such a product!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2024-03-20T16:20:15.939Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
