        "raw": "I'm an avid Spirit Island player who has logged more than 100 plays since I bought the game last year! As such, my island boards are starting to show A LOT of wear, especially around the edges and the pointy part of the board. Are there any plans to release a \"deluxe\" island board of any kind? Something that's made out of wood maybe? I know my friends and I would pay a premium price for such a product!",
