        "raw": "Welcome! Glad you found the game! :smiley:\n\nThey haven't mentioned anything like that, that I've heard. :confused: However, there is the neoprene map of the thematic board that is great, if you think you'd enjoy that. (The new one, not the old one. The new one [came with the Jagger Earth Kickstarter](https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/gtgames/spirit-island-jagged-earth/description) and is great for use with the game. The old one is basically a beautiful poster. ;) ) Not sure where it's available, though, unfortunately. :thinking:\n\nBut you could contact GTG directly at contact@greaterthangames.com to ask about potential future options. If they get enough requests, they might consider it -- or at least make replacement boards available.",
